{"seq":2,"slug":"code-comments-and-commits","title":"代码注释与提交信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/code-comments-and-commits","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码注释与提交信息\">代码注释与提交信息</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码注释（code comments）和 Git 提交信息（commit messages）是开发者每天书写量最大的英文文本。虽然它们看似简短、无关紧要，但实际上直接影响代码的可维护性和团队协作效率。好的注释解释 <code>why</code>，好的提交信息记录 <code>what changed and why</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码变更] --&gt; B{需要解释?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Why 不明显| C[写注释]&#10;    B --&gt;|What 需记录| D[写提交信息]&#10;    C --&gt; E[代码审查]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[代码库知识沉淀]\">graph LR\n    A[代码变更] --&gt; B{需要解释?}\n    B --&gt;|Why 不明显| C[写注释]\n    B --&gt;|What 需记录| D[写提交信息]\n    C --&gt; E[代码审查]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[代码库知识沉淀]</pre><p>注释和提交信息在角色和生命周期上有明确区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>代码注释</th>\n<th>提交信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存在位置</td>\n<td>源代码文件中</td>\n<td>Git 历史记录中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>随代码修改而变化</td>\n<td>永久不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心回答</td>\n<td>Why（为什么这样做）</td>\n<td>What + Why（做了什么、为什么）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读者</td>\n<td>未来修改此代码的人</td>\n<td>审查者、未来的考古者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新责任</td>\n<td>修改代码时必须同步更新</td>\n<td>写入后不可修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见错误</td>\n<td>解释 What 而非 Why</td>\n<td>写 &quot;fix bug&quot; 这类无信息量的信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心哲学是：<code>Code tells you how, comments tell you why, commit messages tell you what happened</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注释的-why-not-what-原则\">注释的 Why-Not-What 原则</h2><p>代码注释最常见的错误是解释代码&quot;做了什么&quot;（What），而不是&quot;为什么这样做&quot;（Why）。前者是代码本身应该通过命名和结构表达的，后者才是注释的职责。</p>\n<p>坏的注释（解释 What）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// increment counter by 1&#10;counter += 1;&#10;&#10;// check if user is admin&#10;if (user.role === &#39;admin&#39;) {\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// increment counter by 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// check if user is admin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user.role </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好的注释（解释 Why）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Use manual increment instead of autoIncrement() due to race condition in concurrent writes.&#10;// See: https://github.com/org/repo/issues/1234&#10;counter += 1;&#10;&#10;// Admin bypass: skip rate limiting for internal tools dashboard.&#10;// Product decision from 2024-Q1 review (Slack thread: #platform-decisions/2024-01-15)&#10;if (user.role === &#39;admin&#39;) {\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Use manual increment instead of autoIncrement() due to race condition in concurrent writes.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// See: https://github.com/org/repo/issues/1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Admin bypass: skip rate limiting for internal tools dashboard.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Product decision from 2024-Q1 review (Slack thread: #platform-decisions/2024-01-15)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user.role </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好的注释提供了三类信息：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>技术原因</strong> — 为什么选择这种实现方式而非更常见的方式</li>\n<li><strong>业务背景</strong> — 这段代码背后的产品决策</li>\n<li><strong>引用链接</strong> — 相关的 Issue、Slack 讨论或设计文档</li>\n</ol>\n<p>常见的注释模式及其英文表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注释场景</th>\n<th>英文模式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>临时解决方案</td>\n<td><code>Workaround for...</code></td>\n<td><code>// Workaround for Chrome 120 flexbox bug</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能考虑</td>\n<td><code>Optimization:</code></td>\n<td><code>// Optimization: batch DB queries to reduce N+1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全相关</td>\n<td><code>SECURITY:</code></td>\n<td><code>// SECURITY: sanitize input to prevent XSS</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已知限制</td>\n<td><code>Limitation:</code></td>\n<td><code>// Limitation: does not handle timezones before 1970</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史原因</td>\n<td><code>Legacy:</code></td>\n<td><code>// Legacy: kept for backward compat with v1 clients</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未来改进</td>\n<td><code>FIXME:</code> / <code>HACK:</code></td>\n<td><code>// FIXME: replace with proper connection pooling</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"conventional-commits-规范\">Conventional Commits 规范</h2><p>Conventional Commits 是目前最广泛采用的提交信息规范，其格式为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;subject&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;body&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;footer&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;subject></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;footer></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Type</strong> 的常用值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>feat</code> — 新功能</li>\n<li><code>fix</code> — 修复 bug</li>\n<li><code>docs</code> — 文档更新</li>\n<li><code>refactor</code> — 重构（不改变功能）</li>\n<li><code>perf</code> — 性能优化</li>\n<li><code>test</code> — 添加或修改测试</li>\n<li><code>chore</code> — 构建工具、CI、依赖更新等</li>\n<li><code>style</code> — 代码格式（不影响逻辑）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Subject</strong> 的写作规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用祈使语气（imperative mood）：<code>add</code> 而非 <code>added</code> 或 <code>adds</code></li>\n<li>首字母小写</li>\n<li>不加句号</li>\n<li>控制在 50 个字符以内</li>\n</ul>\n<p>好的 subject：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>feat(auth): add OAuth 2.0 PKCE flow support</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>fix(cache): prevent stale entries from being served after TTL</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>refactor(api): extract validation logic into middleware</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>坏的 subject：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fixed the bug（不符合祈使语气）feat: update stuff（过于模糊）FEAT(AUTH): ADD OAUTH（不要全大写）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Conventional Commit 结构&#10;        A[type] --&gt; B[scope]&#10;        B --&gt; C[subject]&#10;        C --&gt; D[body]&#10;        D --&gt; E[footer]&#10;    end&#10;    F[feat/fix/docs...] --&gt; A&#10;    G[模块名] --&gt; B&#10;    H[祈使语气 50字符] --&gt; C&#10;    I[详细说明 Why] --&gt; D&#10;    J[Breaking Change/Issue 引用] --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    subgraph Conventional Commit 结构\n        A[type] --&gt; B[scope]\n        B --&gt; C[subject]\n        C --&gt; D[body]\n        D --&gt; E[footer]\n    end\n    F[feat/fix/docs...] --&gt; A\n    G[模块名] --&gt; B\n    H[祈使语气 50字符] --&gt; C\n    I[详细说明 Why] --&gt; D\n    J[Breaking Change/Issue 引用] --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"提交-body-与-footer-的写法\">提交 Body 与 Footer 的写法</h2><p>当 subject 无法完整表达变更内容时，需要在 body 中提供详细说明。Body 的核心职责是回答 <code>Why this change</code> 和 <code>What was the alternative</code>。</p>\n<p>完整的提交信息示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"fix(auth): handle token refresh race condition&#10;&#10;When multiple API calls triggered simultaneously, the token refresh&#10;logic could fire multiple concurrent refresh requests. This led to&#10;intermittent 401 errors as stale tokens were used before the refresh&#10;completed.&#10;&#10;The fix introduces a mutex lock around the refresh flow, ensuring only&#10;one refresh request is in-flight at any time. Subsequent calls wait&#10;for the pending refresh to complete.&#10;&#10;Alternative considered: debouncing the refresh call. Rejected because&#10;it could delay legitimate token refreshes under high concurrency.&#10;&#10;Fixes #4521&#10;Co-authored-by: Sarah Chen &lt;sarah@company.com&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fix(auth): handle token refresh race condition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>When multiple API calls triggered simultaneously, the token refresh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>logic could fire multiple concurrent refresh requests. This led to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>intermittent 401 errors as stale tokens were used before the refresh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>completed.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>The fix introduces a mutex lock around the refresh flow, ensuring only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>one refresh request is in-flight at any time. Subsequent calls wait</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for the pending refresh to complete.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Alternative considered: debouncing the refresh call. Rejected because</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>it could delay legitimate token refreshes under high concurrency.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Fixes #4521</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Co-authored-by: Sarah Chen &#x3C;sarah@company.com></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Body 的写作原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用空行将 subject 和 body 分隔</li>\n<li>每行限制在 72 个字符以内（Git 的传统约定）</li>\n<li>第一段说明问题（What was wrong）</li>\n<li>第二段说明解决方案（How it was fixed）</li>\n<li>第三段说明被否决的替代方案（What was considered but rejected）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Footer 中常用的标记：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标记</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Fixes #N</code></td>\n<td>关联并关闭 Issue</td>\n<td><code>Fixes #4521</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Refs #N</code></td>\n<td>引用但不关闭 Issue</td>\n<td><code>Refs #4500</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BREAKING CHANGE:</code></td>\n<td>标记不兼容变更</td>\n<td><code>BREAKING CHANGE: remove v1 auth endpoints</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Co-authored-by:</code></td>\n<td>标记共同作者</td>\n<td><code>Co-authored-by: Name &lt;email&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Reviewed-by:</code></td>\n<td>标记审查者</td>\n<td><code>Reviewed-by: Name &lt;email&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jsdoc-与-tsdoc-注释规范\">JSDoc 与 TSDoc 注释规范</h2><p>函数级注释在 TypeScript/JavaScript 生态中使用 JSDoc/TSDoc 格式。好的函数注释应描述函数的契约（contract），而非实现细节。</p>\n<p>标准格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"/**&#10; * Resolves a user by ID, falling back to email lookup if ID is not found.&#10; *&#10; * @param identifier - User ID (preferred) or email address&#10; * @param options - Lookup configuration&#10; * @param options.includeDeleted - Whether to include soft-deleted users&#10; * @returns The resolved user, or null if not found&#10; * @throws {AuthorizationError} If the caller lacks read permission&#10; *&#10; * @example&#10; * ```typescript&#10; * const user = await resolveUser(&#39;usr_abc123&#39;);&#10; * const userByEmail = await resolveUser(&#39;alice@example.com&#39;, { includeDeleted: true });&#10; * ```&#10; */&#10;async function resolveUser(&#10;  identifier: string,&#10;  options?: ResolveOptions&#10;): Promise&lt;User | null&gt; {\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * Resolves a user by ID, falling back to email lookup if ID is not found.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identifier</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - User ID (preferred) or email address</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> options</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - Lookup configuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> options.includeDeleted</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - Whether to include soft-deleted users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@returns</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> The resolved user, or null if not found</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@throws</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> {AuthorizationError}</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> If the caller lacks read permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@example</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * ```typescript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * const user = await resolveUser('usr_abc123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * const userByEmail = await resolveUser('alice@example.com', { includeDeleted: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * ```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  identifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResolveOptions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">User</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JSDoc 注释的关键规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一行是功能摘要，使用 <strong>第三人称单数</strong>：<code>Resolves...</code> 而非 <code>Resolve...</code> 或 <code>This function resolves...</code></li>\n<li><code>@param</code> 描述参数的意义，不重复类型信息（TypeScript 已提供类型）</li>\n<li><code>@returns</code> 描述返回值的含义，包括边界情况（如 <code>null</code>）</li>\n<li><code>@throws</code> 列出可能抛出的异常及条件</li>\n<li><code>@example</code> 提供可运行的使用示例</li>\n</ul>\n<p>避免写这样的 JSDoc：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"/**&#10; * This is the resolveUser function.&#10; * @param identifier - the identifier parameter&#10; * @returns the return value&#10; */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * This is the resolveUser function.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identifier</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> - the identifier parameter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@returns</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> the return value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种注释提供的信息为零，纯粹是噪音。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代码注释与提交信息))&#10;    代码注释&#10;      Why Not What&#10;      技术原因&#10;      业务背景&#10;      引用链接&#10;    提交信息&#10;      Conventional Commits&#10;      祈使语气&#10;      50 字符 Subject&#10;    提交 Body&#10;      问题描述&#10;      解决方案&#10;      否决的替代方案&#10;    JSDoc&#10;      第三人称摘要&#10;      @param @returns @throws&#10;      可运行 @example\">mindmap\n  root((代码注释与提交信息))\n    代码注释\n      Why Not What\n      技术原因\n      业务背景\n      引用链接\n    提交信息\n      Conventional Commits\n      祈使语气\n      50 字符 Subject\n    提交 Body\n      问题描述\n      解决方案\n      否决的替代方案\n    JSDoc\n      第三人称摘要\n      @param @returns @throws\n      可运行 @example</pre><ul>\n<li>代码注释解释 <code>Why</code>，代码本身表达 <code>What</code> 和 <code>How</code></li>\n<li>使用 <code>Workaround for</code>、<code>Optimization:</code>、<code>SECURITY:</code> 等标准前缀提高注释可扫读性</li>\n<li>提交信息遵循 Conventional Commits 格式：<code>type(scope): subject</code></li>\n<li>Subject 使用祈使语气、首字母小写、50 字符以内、不加句号</li>\n<li>Body 回答三个问题：出了什么问题、怎么修的、为什么不用其他方案</li>\n<li>JSDoc 第一行用第三人称单数描述功能，<code>@param</code> 不重复类型信息</li>\n<li>所有注释在代码变更时必须同步更新，过时的注释比没有注释更有害</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码注释与提交信息","id":"代码注释与提交信息"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"注释的 Why-Not-What 原则","id":"注释的-why-not-what-原则"},{"level":2,"text":"Conventional Commits 规范","id":"conventional-commits-规范"},{"level":2,"text":"提交 Body 与 Footer 的写法","id":"提交-body-与-footer-的写法"},{"level":2,"text":"JSDoc 与 TSDoc 注释规范","id":"jsdoc-与-tsdoc-注释规范"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"README 与 API 文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/readme-and-api-docs"},"next":{"title":"PR 描述写作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/pr-descriptions"}}